<title>UK: Euromarket turnover fell in week to May 1 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover fell in week to May 1 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets fell to $833.56 billion in the week to April 24 from $978.44 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     51.11		52.35</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     31.46		27.81</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  782.44	     926.08</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    199.40	     193.22</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	613.75	     710.99</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    219.81	     267.44</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
